{"3653590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "N.O.X.", "steam_appid": 3653590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N.O.X. puts you in the role of a supernatural investigator. Alone or with friends, you’ll search for clues, identify the spirit, and carry out the ritual needed to send it back. The game is built around replayability, with randomised maps, shifting conditions, and entities that never behave the same way twice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/c31dfbed937266834d1207215824a4d8.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each investigation requires you to collect three pieces of evidence from a pool of seven. You’ll rely on devices like spirit boxes, EMF readers, and thermal scanners, but equipment doesn’t last forever. Batteries run out, tools fail, and you’ll need to adapt on the spot. Many tools come in different forms, letting you choose the approach that fits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Types of Evidence</strong> - From invisible handprints and temperature fluctuations to eerie whispers from the other side, each piece of evidence helps reveal the entity you're facing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Batteries have a Lifespan</strong> - Some tools rely on energy, and batteries can die unexpectedly. Always keep an eye on power levels and swap out equipment before you find yourself in a dangerous situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Variations -</strong> Certain tools come in multiple forms. Choosing the right tool for the situation and your playstyle will make your investigation more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1394866c908e4acc994f16cfe848ec02.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1394866c908e4acc994f16cfe848ec02.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1394866c908e4acc994f16cfe848ec02.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/727a62a64e5997cc8046e9684281c2b2.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than twenty types of spirits, each with its own abilities. Some prefer to stalk you slowly, others attack without hesitation, and some can possess your teammates. When that happens, trust inside the group quickly breaks down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/e02b2d4a1ed8c39f97aab6e37309b79f.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/e02b2d4a1ed8c39f97aab6e37309b79f.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/e02b2d4a1ed8c39f97aab6e37309b79f.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/18ea931d4a8b139bf9fc2ff733d870c9.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the spirit is identified, you’ll need to drive it out. Over ten different rituals exist, each tied to specific weaknesses. Picking the wrong ritual will only strengthen and intensify the ghost's power and aggression.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 Unique Spirits - Each ghost is unique and requires a different approach to banish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Exorcism Methods - Each type of spirit requires a unique ritual to be banished. Some may require special incantations, while others demand the burning of cursed objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be Careful with Your Choices! - If you perform the wrong ritual, the spirit might grow angry and hunt you down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/79986171b0d7f3ae04e84f1ea70a1ee6.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/79986171b0d7f3ae04e84f1ea70a1ee6.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/79986171b0d7f3ae04e84f1ea70a1ee6.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/63d1e2017b662706c6efe64ca05eadd2.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different. House layouts, hiding places, and evidence spots change each time you enter. Randomised conditions and character afflictions keep you guessing, and failed missions leave lasting consequences that shape your next investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1aa9a55ac48c98e25698e4d11d5ff351.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1aa9a55ac48c98e25698e4d11d5ff351.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1aa9a55ac48c98e25698e4d11d5ff351.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/6382c0f9f3b2bbe60c6985f4bffa1b7e.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses 3D scans of real haunted places to create locations that feel unsettling and authentic. Combined with Unreal Engine 5 lighting, sound, and detail, every investigation feels like you’ve truly stepped into somewhere you shouldn’t be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/f55dd9cfb0a9325bfd81d1aba9baec0a.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/f55dd9cfb0a9325bfd81d1aba9baec0a.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/f55dd9cfb0a9325bfd81d1aba9baec0a.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure endless challenges, the game features a random map and house layout system, so every time you step into a haunted location, the experience will be different.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing Locations Every Time -</strong> The structure, room layout, evidence positions, and hiding spots will never be the same, forcing you to adapt with each encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Life Haunted Locations -</strong> Experience the haunting atmosphere of real-life haunted places, recreated through 3D scanning technology for an authentic and terrifying experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Graphics and Sound with Unreal Engine 5 -</strong> Powered by cutting-edge graphics technology, the game delivers sharp details, realistic lighting and shadows, and chilling soundscapes that make you feel like you're truly in a haunted place.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N.O.X. puts you in the role of a supernatural investigator. Alone or with friends, you’ll search for clues, identify the spirit, and carry out the ritual needed to send it back. The game is built around replayability, with randomised maps, shifting conditions, and entities that never behave the same way twice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/c31dfbed937266834d1207215824a4d8.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each investigation requires you to collect three pieces of evidence from a pool of seven. You’ll rely on devices like spirit boxes, EMF readers, and thermal scanners, but equipment doesn’t last forever. Batteries run out, tools fail, and you’ll need to adapt on the spot. Many tools come in different forms, letting you choose the approach that fits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Types of Evidence</strong> - From invisible handprints and temperature fluctuations to eerie whispers from the other side, each piece of evidence helps reveal the entity you're facing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Batteries have a Lifespan</strong> - Some tools rely on energy, and batteries can die unexpectedly. Always keep an eye on power levels and swap out equipment before you find yourself in a dangerous situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Variations -</strong> Certain tools come in multiple forms. Choosing the right tool for the situation and your playstyle will make your investigation more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1394866c908e4acc994f16cfe848ec02.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1394866c908e4acc994f16cfe848ec02.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/1394866c908e4acc994f16cfe848ec02.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/727a62a64e5997cc8046e9684281c2b2.avif?t=1770642778\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than twenty types of spirits, each with its own abilities. Some prefer to stalk you slowly, others attack without hesitation, and some can possess your teammates. When that happens, trust inside the group quickly breaks down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/e02b2d4a1ed8c39f97aab6e37309b79f.poster.