apps/3653590/extras/f55dd9cfb0a9325bfd81d1aba9baec0a.poster.avif?t=1770642778\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/f55dd9cfb0a9325bfd81d1aba9baec0a.webm?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653590/extras/f55dd9cfb0a9325bfd81d1aba9baec0a.mp4?t=1770642778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure endless challenges, the game features a random map and house layout system, so every time you step into a haunted location, the experience will be different.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing Locations Every Time -</strong> The structure, room layout, evidence positions, and hiding spots will never be the same, forcing you to adapt with each encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Life Haunted Locations -</strong> Experience the haunting atmosphere of real-life haunted places, recreated through 3D scanning technology for an authentic and terrifying experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Graphics and Sound with Unreal Engine 5 -</strong> Powered by cutting-edge graphics technology, the game delivers sharp details, realistic lighting and shadows, and chilling soundscapes that make you feel like you're truly in a haunted place.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "N.O.X. is a co-op horror game where up to four players take on the roles of paranormal investigators. Players must find clues, identify the type of spirit, and banish it using their tools, either alone or together with their crew.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.ak